    "usecase3_badge": "In-app viewing only",
    "usecase3_body": "Ana adds a photo to her album with Carlos. The image travels encrypted from her phone to Carlos's and is stored only in XowApp's private space. The server acts as a bridge: it keeps the encrypted file until every recipient has received it, and never for more than 30 days. Carlos can see the photo, but he can't save it to his gallery, forward it or take screenshots.",
    "usecase3_flow_step1_title": "Alice adds photo",
