    "usecase4_badge": "Total control",
    "usecase4_body": "If Ana decides to delete a photo she uploaded, it disappears from Carlos's phone (and from every member's, if it's a group) as soon as they connect. Whoever uploads a photo always has the final say.",
    "usecase4_flow_step1_title": "Alice taps delete",
